The **attack surface** is the collection of possible entry points that could be targeted.

Examples:

```text
Login
Registration
Search
File Upload
API
URL Parameters
Forms
Cookies
Headers
Admin Panel
Password Reset
Payment Function
```

### Memory

> **Every input, function, endpoint, and access path can potentially become part of the attack surface.**

